.TH "WISWA-VCS" "1" "Jun 01, 2026" "0.1.0" "wiswa-vcs"
.SH NAME
wiswa-vcs \- wiswa-vcs v0.1.0
.sp
Cross\-host VCS metadata sync and mirroring helpers used by Wiswa.
.SH WISWA-SYNC-GH-GL
.sp
Mirror GitHub metadata, protected refs, and badges to a GitLab project.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
wiswa\-sync\-gh\-gl [OPTIONS]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-badges\-file <badges_file>
reStructuredText badges file to sync; skipped if it does not exist.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Default
\fB\(aqdocs/badges.rst\(aq\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
Enable debug level logging.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-default\-branch <default_branch>
\fBRequired\fP Default branch name; always added to the protected branches list.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-github\-repo\-uri <github_repo_uri>
\fBRequired\fP Source GitHub repository URI (for example \fIhttps://github.com/owner/repo.git\fP) or \fIowner/repo\fP slug.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-github\-token <github_token>
\fBRequired\fP GitHub personal access token used to read repository metadata.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-gitlab\-config <gitlab_config>
JSON object literal, or the path to a JSON file, with optional \fIproject_settings\fP, \fIpush_rules\fP, \fIproject_approvals\fP, and \fIdefault_branch_protection\fP tables.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-gitlab\-repo\-uri <gitlab_repo_uri>
\fBRequired\fP HTTPS URI of the destination GitLab repository.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-gitlab\-token <gitlab_token>
\fBRequired\fP GitLab personal access token with the \fIapi\fP scope.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-no\-mirror\-overrides
Skip the read\-only mirror project setting overrides (merge requests, CI/CD, LFS, and service desk are otherwise disabled).
.UNINDENT
.sp
